        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Clash of Arcade Classics </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pac-Snec</strong> is the ultimate  high-score hunting  challenge of two beloved arcade genres into a single, intensely replayable experience. Grab that nostalgia and hold it close as you deep dive into a retro-inspired world where every move counts and the maze is your hunting ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay &amp; Mechanics </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the <strong>Snec</strong>, a snake like entity tasked with navigating a procedurally generated <strong>Labyrinth</strong>. Your one true goal is consumption and dominance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consume &amp; Grow:</strong> Weave through the maze and devour scattered <strong>Orbs</strong>. Each orb increases your score and, crucially, your length.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deeper Challenge:</strong> The longer your Snec grows, the more challenging the Labyrinth becomes. Collision with  your own increasingly lengthy tail results in a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Survive, grow, and secure your position at the top of the <strong>Global Leaderboards (WIP)</strong> for ultimate bragging rights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features &amp; Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Labyrinth is not empty. Lurking within are <strong>Spectres</strong>, agile creatures that patrol the maze.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the Spectres:</strong> These creatures will chase and trap you. Mastering the map layout and predicting their movement is key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression (WIP):</strong> Unlock new Snec bodies, unique visual trail effects, and spectral Spectre Skins<strong> </strong>as you achieve high scores and complete in-game milestones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-rich, dedicated arcade experience, designed for both quick sessions and deep mastery:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Replayability:</strong> Navigate procedurally generated maps. No two Labyrinths are ever the same, ensuring a fresh challenge on every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong> Test your skills in different ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> The pure, unforgiving arcade experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead End Mode:</strong> Plan ahead, dead ends are unforgiving and portaling into a Spectre is less than ideal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who You Gonna Call?:</strong> Play with <strong>NO Spectres!</strong> Easily customise your game to remove the threats and avoid your tail at any means necessary.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Clash of Arcade Classics </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pac-Snec</strong> is the ultimate  high-score hunting  challenge of two beloved arcade genres into a single, intensely replayable experience. Grab that nostalgia and hold it close as you deep dive into a retro-inspired world where every move counts and the maze is your hunting ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay &amp; Mechanics </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the <strong>Snec</strong>, a snake like entity tasked with navigating a procedurally generated <strong>Labyrinth</strong>. Your one true goal is consumption and dominance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consume &amp; Grow:</strong> Weave through the maze and devour scattered <strong>Orbs</strong>. Each orb increases your score and, crucially, your length.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deeper Challenge:</strong> The longer your Snec grows, the more challenging the Labyrinth becomes. Collision with  your own increasingly lengthy tail results in a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Survive, grow, and secure your position at the top of the <strong>Global Leaderboards (WIP)</strong> for ultimate bragging rights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features &amp; Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Labyrinth is not empty. Lurking within are <strong>Spectres</strong>, agile creatures that patrol the maze.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the Spectres:</strong> These creatures will chase and trap you. Mastering the map layout and predicting their movement is key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression (WIP):</strong> Unlock new Snec bodies, unique visual trail effects, and spectral Spectre Skins<strong> </strong>as you achieve high scores and complete in-game milestones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-rich, dedicated arcade experience, designed for both quick sessions and deep mastery:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Replayability:</strong> Navigate procedurally generated maps. No two Labyrinths are ever the same, ensuring a fresh challenge on every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong> Test your skills in different ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> The pure, unforgiving arcade experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead End Mode:</strong> Plan ahead, dead ends are unforgiving and portaling into a Spectre is less than ideal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who You Gonna Call?:</strong> Play with <strong>NO Spectres!</strong> Easily customise your game to remove the threats and avoid your tail at any means necessary.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Have a nostalgic trip back in time to experience a fresh take on some classics. Eat orbs and extend your Snec to become the longest and coolest in the world!",
